SRSB HRMS

Complete Salary & Payroll Flow Analysis

Technical + Business documentation (code-verified, read-only analysis)

Generated: 26/9/2026, 5:45:24 pm
Source: Existing SRSB HRMS codebase (frontend, backend, migrations, RBAC). No assumptions of unimplemented features.
Purpose: Reference document before further implementation. Accuracy prioritized over completeness of wish-list features.

1. Executive Summary

Salary & Payroll is a company-scoped, CTC-driven, backend-calculated pipeline:
 • Employee is created without salary.
 • Admin/HR/SA enter Annual CTC; engine builds components from salary_configurations.
 • Employee punches daily into attendance.
 • Admin/HR create a payroll run, then Calculate (live attendance + active CTC).
 • Status: DRAFT !’ SUBMITTED !’ APPROVED !’ LOCKED !’ PAID.
 • On Mark Paid, payslip_records are created; employee downloads via My Payslips (client-side jsPDF).

Employee portal does NOT show live CTC/structure — only generated payslips.

