3. Super Admin Role

 • Salary Configuration: Yes (permission always true for SA)
 • Employee CTC, payroll full lifecycle including reopen: Yes
 • Employee Payslips nav page: Hidden in AppLayout
 • Open payslip by ID: Allowed
 • My Employee Portal shortcut: No (non-SA only)
Files: payrollRoutes.js, AppLayout.jsx, permissionService.js

4. Admin Role

 • Create/update employees, salary config, CTC: Yes
 • Payroll create/calculate/submit/approve/lock/paid: Yes
 • Reopen: No
 • Attendance, corrections, override: Yes
 • Employee Payslips + My Employee Portal: Yes

5. HR Role

 • Employees, salary config, CTC: Yes
 • Payroll create/calculate/submit: Yes
 • Approve/Lock/Mark Paid: Route blocked (SA/ADMIN only)
 • Corrections + override + Employee Payslips + Employee Portal: Yes

6. Manager Role

 • List employees: Yes; Create employee: No
 • Salary config update: No; salary setup GET: permission gap risk
 • Payroll runs/dashboard: View only
 • Calculate/submit/approve: No
 • Attendance + correction approval: Yes; Manual override: No
 • Employee Payslips + My Employee Portal: Yes
Seed: 007_salary_payroll_assets_access.sql — MANAGER payroll view only, no salary row.

7. Employee Role

 • Punch in/out, my attendance, correction request, leave: Yes
 • Live My Salary / CTC screen: NOT IMPLEMENTED
 • My Payslips (own only): Yes
Nav: employeeNavigation in navigation.js

