9. CTC !’ Salary Components

Input: Annual CTC only. Monthly CTC = annual / 12. Engine: calculateSalaryStructure in salaryCalculationService.js.

Component           Formula                                  Source

Monthly CTC         annualCtc / 12                           computed

Basic               monthlyCtc × basic_percent/100           config (default 40)

DA                  basic × da_percent_of_basic/100          config (default 0)

HRA                 basic × hra_percent_of_basic/100         config (default 50)

Employer PF         min(Basic+DA, ceiling) × er%             config

Gratuity            if enabled: basic × gratuity%            config + flags

Special Allowance   monthlyCtc " basic"da"hra"erPF"gratuity  residual

Bonus               optional % of basic by type              config + flags

Attendance Bonus    flat if attendance% "e min               config + flags

Conveyance / Other  NOT IMPLEMENTED                          —

Gross (month)       payable earnings + bonuses               engine

Net                 Gross " Emp PF " PT " ESI " other        engine

APIs: POST /payroll/calculate-preview, PUT /payroll/employee/:id/setup. Display: PayrollPage Breakdown. Employee portal: not
until payslip.

10. Salary Configuration !’ Payroll Connection

CONNECTED: salary_configurations !’ getSalaryConfiguration !’ calculateSalaryStructure / calculateEmployeeSalary !’ CTC save
+ payroll Calculate.

 • Used: basic/da/hra %, PF, PT, optional ESI, bonus, attendance bonus, gratuity, payroll_day_basis, company_address
 • statutory_rules can merge PT; ESI is config-driven

