13. Daily Attendance Status

Status                          How determined                      Payroll effect
PRESENT                         Punch-in; punch-out "e480 min       +1 paid day
HALF_DAY                        Punch-out 180–479 min               +0.5 paid
ABSENT                          Punch-out <180 min                  +1 LOP
LEAVE                           Enum; leave approve does NOT write  Would be paid if present
                                attendance
WEEK_OFF                        Enum; no writer found               Would be paid
HOLIDAY                         Enum; no writer found               Would be paid
MISSING_PUNCH                   Enum; no auto-writer found          +1 LOP
Unmarked (no row)               No punch                            Credited as paid (not LOP)

File: attendanceController.js punchOut CASE.

14. Monthly Attendance Calculation

Function: getAttendanceSummary(employeeId, year, month) — queries attendance for month, groups by status. No separate
monthly attendance table.

