34. Recommended Implementation Order

(Guidance only)

 • 1. Confirm correction approve on deployed code uses reviewer_comment
 • 2. Leave approve !’ write attendance LEAVE (or payroll read leave_requests)
 • 3. Decide unmarked-day policy (credit vs LOP)
 • 4. Auto MISSING_PUNCH / WEEK_OFF / HOLIDAY if required
 • 5. Fix MANAGER salary permission vs route
 • 6. Align HR payroll UI with approve restrictions
 • 7. Optional: employee read-only My Salary Structure
 • 8. TDS/loan/conveyance only if product requires

